      "breeding_summary": "When maintaining a live colony, females that are homozygous for both the Rag2 mutation and X-linked Il2rg mutation may be bred to males that are homozygous for the Rag2 mutation and hemizygous for the Il2rg mutation. Mating scheme: See \"Breeding Considerations\" Coat color: Albino Generation: F?+F4pF2",
