          "title": "Dilated cardiomyopathy mutant tropomyosin mice develop cardiac dysfunction with significantly decreased fractional shortening and myofilament calcium sensitivity.",
          "year": "2007",
          "authors": "Rajan S; Ahmed RP; Jagatheesan G; Petrashevskaya N; Boivin GP; Urboniene D; Arteaga GM; Wolska BM; Solaro RJ; Liggett SB; Wieczorek DF",
