      "breeding_summary": "Heterozygotes and homozygotes are viable and fertile. Mating scheme: Homozygote x Homozygote Coat color: Various Generation: +pN1",
      "detailed_desc": "PlexinD1-2A-CreER knock-in mice express a CreERT2 (CreERT2) fusion protein from the Plxnd1 (plexin D1) promoter/enhancer elements. CreERT2 fusion gene activity is inducible and observed following tamoxifen administration. As such, when PlexinD1-2A-CreER mice are bred with mice containing loxP-flanked sequence(s), tamoxifen-inducible Cre-mediated recombination will result in deletion of the floxed sequence(s) in PLXND1-positive cortical glutamatergic pyramidal neurons (PyNs). No other tissues were tested for Cre recombinase activity. The donating investigator reports that there is no Cre recombinase activity before tamoxifen treatment. Homozygous mice are viable and fertile. A set of temporally inducible mouse Cre and Flp knock-in driver lines that enable combinatorial targeting of major progenitor types and projection classes of glutamatergic pyramidal neurons (PyNs) and their progenitors were described in Matho et al, 2020 (BioRxiv). These gene knock-in's recapitulate the endogenous spatial, temporal and cellular expression patterns of transcription factors and effector genes. Several of these strains are available through The Jackson Laboratory: Driver Lines: Lhx2-2A-CreER 036293 PlexinD1-2A-CreER 036294 PlexinD1-2A-flpO 036295 Fezf2-2A-CreER 036296 Fezf2-2A-flpO 036297 Tle4-2A-CreER 036298 Tbr1-2A-CreER 036299 Cux1-2A-CreER 036300 Tbr2-2A-CreER 036301 Tis21-2A-CreER 036303 Adcyap1-2A-CreER 033999 Tcerg1l-2A-CreER 034000 Reporter Line: 4 Dual-tTA 036304 分子注记：The allele was generated by inserting a 2A-CreER expression cassette in-frame before the STOP codon of the Plxnd1 gene. The targeting vectors generated using BAC clones from the RPCI-23&24 library were electroporated into a 129SVj/B6 hybrid ES cell line (v6.5). The Resulting ES cell clones were used for tetraploid complementation to obtain male heterozygous mice. The neo selection cassette was excised by crossing to FlpE strain mice."
