          "title": "IFN-gamma causes aplastic anemia by altering hematopoietic stem/progenitor cell composition and disrupting lineage differentiation.",
          "year": "2014",
          "authors": "Lin FC; Karwan M; Saleh B; Hodge DL; Chan T; Boelte KC; Keller JR; Young HA",
