          "title": "A total fibrinogen deficiency is compatible with the development of pulmonary fibrosis in mice.",
          "year": "2000",
          "authors": "Ploplis VA; Wilberding J; McLennan L; Liang Z; Cornelissen I; DeFord ME; Rosen ED; Castellino FJ",
