          "title": "ALS-linked TDP-43 mutations produce aberrant RNA splicing and adult-onset motor neuron disease without aggregation or loss of nuclear TDP-43.",
          "year": "2013",
          "authors": "Arnold ES; Ling SC; Huelga SC; Lagier-Tourenne C; Polymenidou M; Ditsworth D; Kordasiewicz HB; McAlonis-Downes M; Platoshyn O; Parone PA; Da Cruz S; Clutario KM; Swing D; Tessarollo L; Marsala M; Shaw CE; Yeo GW; Cleveland DW",
